---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">Reeve: From Bank SMS to a Filed Transaction</p>

  <div class="node-wrap">
    <div class="node node-dark node-lg">
      <div>Bank SMS arrives</div>
      <div class="node-sub">OTPs, chats and everything else from unknown senders are dropped here and never stored.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="node-wrap">
    <div class="node node-gate">
      <div class="gate-title">1. Write the raw message to a local queue first</div>
      <div class="gate-signals">Nothing is parsed or sent until it is on disk. Message ID is a hash of sender, second and text, so a retry or a re-scan can never create it twice.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="node-wrap">
    <div class="node node-lg">
      <div class="gate-title">2. Background worker, when there is a network</div>
      <div class="gate-signals">Parse on the device against 25 known templates. Retry with backoff.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="branch-grid cols-2">
    <div class="b-col">
      <div class="v-drop"></div>
      <div class="option-card">
        <div class="option-letter">No template matched</div>
        <div class="option-title">Stays on the phone</div>
        <div class="option-desc">Text kept locally for 30 days so a new template can be written. Nothing reaches the server.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-rise"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="b-col">
      <div class="v-drop"></div>
      <div class="option-card option-card-chosen">
        <div class="option-letter option-letter-blue">Template matched</div>
        <div class="option-title">Structured fields only</div>
        <div class="option-desc">Amount, direction, merchant, account, date. No message text. Inserted with a deterministic ID, so the insert is idempotent.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-rise"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="node-wrap">
    <div class="node node-dark node-lg">
      <div>Confirmed only if the account is known AND a rule says auto-confirm.</div>
      <div class="node-sub">Everything else lands in the review queue. The system never guesses a category on its own.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .node-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .node-lg { max-width: 460px; width: 100%; }

  .node {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .node-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }
  .node-sub {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(249, 247, 244, 0.6);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .node-gate {
    max-width: 460px;
    width: 100%;
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }
  .gate-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .gate-signals {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .v-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .v-drop, .v-rise {
    width: 1px;
    height: 16px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .branch-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .cols-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

  .cols-2::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    top: 8px;
    left: 25%;
    right: 25%;
  }
  .cols-2::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 25%;
    right: 25%;
  }

  .b-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .option-card {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 14px 16px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .option-card-chosen {
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .option-letter {
    font-size: 9px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .option-letter-blue {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .option-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .option-desc {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .branch-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cols-2::before, .cols-2::after { display: none; }
    .v-drop, .v-rise { display: none; }
  }
</style>
